  "description": "Comprehensive CAT-1 test suite covering all 10 universal enumeration domains: Awards, ECs, Summer Programs, Academics (Transcript + GPA), Testing, Demographics, Narrative,  College List, Outcomes. 30 test scenarios validating deterministic SQL routing.",
